      "writtenOn": "2021-07-13T07:18:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Keep in mind that doing the test here will mean an app will be able to use reflection to manually send this message. I don\u0027t think this is a very large problem, but it may be safer to check this on the service side instead.\n\n(then you\u0027d need add an argument to isChangeEnabled with the UID of the app, and I think you\u0027d need to add a method to AsyncChannel to obtain it)\n\nThe code on the service side would also be cleaner because you could simply look up the UID when the client object is constructed, rather than having a setter to do it later.",
